  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building for the use of sectoral Medium Term Expenditure Frameworks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will support targeted ministries in the establishment and implementation of sectoral medium term expenditure frameworks (MTEFs)comma in order to better align the allocation of budgetary resources according to: (i) the priorities of the PRSP; (ii) the financing needs of sectoral programs; and (iii) sectoral action plans. The activity builds off similar efforts undertaken in a number of pilot ministries funded by an earlier World Bank TA and with the support of other donors (Belgiumcomma EUcomma Francecomma...). This aims to reinforce the capacity of targeted ministries to: (i) build realisticcomma costed sector strategies and priority action plans; (ii) establish and implement sector medium term expenditure frameworks (MTEFs); and (iii) link the sector MTEFs to the preparation and monitoring of the PRSP.  More generallycomma the targeted ministries will learn through the proposed activities to use sector MTEFs to better align the allocation of budgetary resources according to: (i) the priorities of the PRSP; (ii) the financing needs of sector programs; and (iii) sector action plans.</narrative>
  </description>
